# This working copy tracks only Rendy's part of the project:
#   Task 1 (station export + data generation), Task 2 (event stream + MQTT publisher),
#   shared configuration, README, requirements and the local broker configuration.
# Everything else (other members' modules, the provided generator, data, databases, the
# virtual environment) is ignored by default and re-included below file by file.

/*
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/requirements.txt

!/evstream/
/evstream/*
!/evstream/__init__.py
!/evstream/config.py
!/evstream/stations.py
!/evstream/generation.py
!/evstream/stream.py
!/evstream/publisher.py
!/evstream/dashboard/

!/mosquitto/
__pycache__/
.DS_Store
